// spirv-tools/libspirv.hpp
// mlx-spirv: SPIRV-Tools' C++ header, empty. The SPIR-V tools (validator,
// disassembler, optimizer) are not here; ANGLE's translator includes this
// for a disassembly it makes only when ANGLE_DEBUG_SPIRV_GENERATION is on,
// and ANGLE's own helpers that use it are the port's (Validate, Print in
// projects/webkit/port/angle/angle_spirv_utils.cpp).
